The files under data/ (people, relationships, annotated cross-references,
chronology, eras) are editorial work by Curtis Hoffmann and are released under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

The scripture text under public/text/ and the reference listing under
public/refs/ derive from the LDS Scriptures dataset (scriptures.nephi.org,
2020-12-08 edition), which publishes them as public domain. The verse-aligned
quotation pairs in public/refs/ are computed from that text.
